ut` | 0.2 → 0.1 | Helps if val AUC < train AUC |\n| `max_seq_len` | 100 → 200 | More context per student |\n| `decay_init` | 1.0 → 0.5 | Slower initial forgetting |\n| `lr` | 1e-3 → 5e-4 | More stable convergence |\n| `min_seq_len` | 5 → 10 | Removes noisy short sequences |\n| Add second attention layer | Stack two `DecayAttention` blocks | +0.01–0.02 |\n\n**Re-run training with new config:**\n```python\nCONFIG['embed_dim'] = 128\nCONFIG['dropout']   = 0.1\n# then re-run cells 6–9\n```\n\n---\n\n**After training completes:**\n1. Download `sakt_decay_best.pt` and commit to your GitHub repo\n2. Download `skill_encoder_real.csv` → replace `data/skill_encoder_v2.csv` in the repo\n3. Update `README.md` with real benchmark numbers from `benchmark.json`\n4. Tag `v0.2.0` on GitHub","metadata":{}}]}